  "2026-11-24T20:40:22.828Z",codex-agent,"The installed pm-changelog 2026.11.20 passes the fetched-tag check on main. Add a real tracker and git fixture for prepared empty notes, post-tag stability, and preservation of legitimate pending changes. Use the reported 2026.10.31 pin as the behavioral revert."
  "2026-11-24T20:44:47.938Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert: substituting the published 2026.10.31 generator alone made changelog:check return 1 after tagging and add the empty Unreleased / No changes block. Restored 2026.11.20 passes before and after tagging and reports a real pending delivery until regeneration. The existing scripts retain dated empty sections and run checking without writes."
